{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2026-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1782864000, "end_date": 1783468799, "month_true_total": 439, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:21:16 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229887024", "author": {"steamid": "76561198791856533", "personaname": "TheEnjenir", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198791856533/", "num_games_owned": 25, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1266, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 180, "last_played": 1787060873, "avatar": "a290dff72ccd72fdee710a6d182c48eb483a6d57"}, "language": "english", "review": "A little too realistic, but that's the point of the game. This game is what every \"Realistic military shooter\" wants to be", "timestamp_created": 1783461831, "timestamp_updated": 1783461831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "6063", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Athlon Gold 3150U with Radeon Graphics     ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics", "vram_size": 2033}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229886256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198859310981", "personaname": "Pickle Rick (🇬🇷)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/helloboidatbruh/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 757, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 757, "last_played": 1758098421, "avatar": "89ca723bb1723bb85413199df4c92615ac14ec75"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]A Great Idea, But a Frustrating Experience[/h1]\n\n[b]Not Recommended[/b]\n\nI really wanted to enjoy [i]Arma 3[/i], but unfortunately my experience with the game was mostly frustrating.\n\nThe biggest issue for me was the lack of proper explanation of the mechanics. The learning curve is extremely steep, and in the beginning I died at least 8-10 times before I even started to understand what was happening, how the systems worked, and what the game expected from me.\n\nI understand that [i]Arma 3[/i] is meant to be a realistic military simulator, but the game does very little to help new players get into that experience.\n\nAnother major problem is the amount of content locked behind DLC. The base game feels very limited, and many times when I found a mission, weapon, vehicle, or aircraft that looked interesting and wanted to try it, I was immediately greeted with a \"Buy this DLC to access it\" message. After a while, this became really frustrating.\n\nThe potential is clearly there, and I can see why many people love this game, especially with mods and the additional content. However, the base experience feels incomplete without the DLC packs, and the lack of guidance makes it difficult for new players to get invested.", "timestamp_created": 1783461131, "timestamp_updated": 1783461131, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500631451606750488", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229878797", "author": {"steamid": "76561198679751800", "personaname": "Jwe234ET", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198679751800/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 954, "playtime_at_review": 178, "last_played": 1791338185, "avatar": "42334b5d47d148a1046c9d9b04562e8031650f9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "my ears hurt but its ok cuz its fun", "timestamp_created": 1783454561, "timestamp_updated": 1783454561, "voted_up": tru